            "sid": "DEU 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa achienderera kugomba achiamba, “Msilavye sadaka kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, ngʼombe au ngʼondzi mwenye chirema au uyi wowosi; hiro ni dzambo ra kutsukiza kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho mkasikira kukala kuna mmwengawapho wa midzi yenu ambao mwahewa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu, phana mutu anayehenda mai mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu na kuvundza chilaganeche ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 22:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye akaphiya na kuhumikira milungu yanjina na kuiabudu, achiabudu dzuwa, mwezi au vitu vyanjina vya mlunguni ambavyo nakahaza visiabudiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mundachunguza vinono na napho ni kpweli kukala dzambo hiro ra kutsukiza rikahendwa mo Iziraeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "phahi, mumphirike mutu hiye kondze ya midzi na kumpiga mawe hadi afwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.35.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 35:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.18.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 18:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Akorintho 13:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TI.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Timothi 5:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aeburania 10:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo, andaolagbwa tu ichikala phana ushaidi wa atu airi au ahahu. Asiolagbwe ichikala phana ushaidi wa mutu mmwenga bahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.5.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Akorintho 5:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara mashaidi ndio ndioandza kumpiga mawe mwandzo, halafu anjina nao ampige mawe. Ndivyo mndivyosisa uyi kahi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inawezekana kukazuka malau magumu ndani ya midzi yenu, dza vira kesi ya kuolaga, kesi ya kuganya mali na kesi za atu achiolumizana. Phahi, mundauka na kuphiya phatu Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu ariphotsambula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na hiko mundaphiya kpwa Alawi ambao ni alavyadzi-sadaka na muamuli ambaye a kazini wakati hinyo, namwi mundaasemurira shida zenu kpwao nao andakutangazirani uamuli wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu mundahenda dza vira ndivyoatangazira phara phatu Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiphotsambula. Mundakala makini kuhenda gosi dza vira ndivyoalagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundalondwa kuhenda kulengana na malagizo ndigoapha na uamuli ndiolavya kpwenu. Musiriche kuhenda chira arichokuambirani, mkalunga genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye mutu ndiyehenda kpwa ngulu bila kugbwira ga mlavyadzi-sadaka yeikpwa hipho kpwa ajili ya kumuhumikira Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, au muamuli, mutu hiye andaolagbwa. Ndivyo mndivyosisa uyi kahi yenu mwi Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi andasikira na kuogopha asihende tsona chitu kpwa ngulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
